      "writtenOn": "2025-08-08T09:44:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a reason it is a vec4\u003cu32\u003e array and not an array of u32s? Metal shouldn\u0027t have issues loading from an array of u32s.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 330,
        "startChar": 90,
