      "lineNbr": 335,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-08T09:44:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could change [this ASSERT](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/common/Math.cpp;drc\u003daae31cfd0a4d152bacdea12c9eb5c4416d7c79a1;l\u003d132) to be `n \u003e\u003d 0`, add a test, then this line could become:\n\n```\narrayLengthFromConstants.buffer_sizes_offset \u003d RoundUp(pipelineImmediateMask.count() * kImmediateConstantElementByteSize, 16);\n```\n\nAnd if we make the buffers sizes an array\u003cu32\u003e then we can even make this:\n\n```\narrayLengthFromConstants.buffer_sizes_offset \u003d pipelineImmediateMask.count() * kImmediateConstantElementByteSize;\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 332,
        "startChar": 54,
        "endLine": 335,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "29776d7886d27000efdc7933d144bae7d0891fce",
