      "message": "IMHO we should separate the tests because it makes the existing tests no longer well targeted. We are going to need a few more tests for good code coverage so IMHO a new fixture will help have something more targeted.\n\nWe need tests like this:\n\n - SetBindGroup + SetImmediate + Draw\n - SetBindGroup + SetImmediate + Draw + SetPipeline (that uses a different amount of immediates) + Draw (should still see the correct buffer sizes)\n - SetBindGroup + SetImmdiate + Daw + SetPipeline (that uses a different amount of buffer lengths) + SetBindGroup + Draw.\n \netc.\n\nBasically the hard part to make work is not the case where a single `Apply` is called, but when `Apply` is called repeatedly with state changing in between.",
